{"id":"gozan","name":"Gozan","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:gozan"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Gozan","text":"A region in Central Asia to which the Israelites were carried away captive (2 Kings 17:6; 1 Chr. 5:26; 2 Kings 19:12; Isa. 37:12). It was situated in Mesopotamia, on the river Habor (2 Kings 17:6; 18:11), the Khabur, a tributary of the Euphrates. The “river of Gozan” (1 Chr. 5:26) is probably the upper part of the river flowing through the province of Gozan, now Kizzel-Ozan."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H1470","lemma":"גּוֹזָן","xlit":"Gôwzân","gloss":"Gozan, a province of Assyria","kjv":"Gozan","count":4,"share":1},{"strong":"H2477","lemma":"חֲלַח","xlit":"Chălach","gloss":"Chalach, a region of Assyria","kjv":"Halah","count":3,"share":0.75},{"strong":"H2249","lemma":"חָבוֹר","xlit":"Châbôwr","gloss":"Chabor, a river of Assyria","kjv":"Habor","count":3,"share":0.75},{"strong":"H5104","lemma":"נָהָר","xlit":"nâhâr","gloss":"a stream","kjv":"flood, river","count":3,"share":0.75},{"strong":"H804","lemma":"אַשּׁוּר","xlit":"ʼAshshûwr","gloss":"Ashshur, the second son of Shem","kjv":"Asshur, Assur, Assyria, Assyrians. See H838","count":3,"share":0.75},{"strong":"H1540","lemma":"גָּלָה","xlit":"gâlâh","gloss":"to denude","kjv":"advertise, appear, bewray, bring","count":3,"share":0.75}],"verses":["2Kgs.17.6","2Kgs.18.11","2Kgs.19.12","1Chr.5.26"],"related":[{"id":"habor","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.75,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"halah","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.75,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"habor","type":"lexical","strong":"H2477","why":"both lead with חֲלַח (H2477)"},{"id":"halah","type":"lexical","strong":"H2477","why":"both lead with חֲלַח (H2477)"}],"works":[]}
